              "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Make the recorded verifier an ancestor**\n\nFor this reviewed commit, `git merge-base --is-ancestor 08b588f6786c857070e350aeaa6396d85bcc004c 6b01e81c1a8bf5195eddf4932bc72aa1d7d99a51` fails because both commits are children of `1a23f5d`; therefore this row records an unreachable sibling rather than a verifier in the resulting history. If this commit is merged by itself, the ledger cannot recover that verifier through `main`, and the accompanying work record's direct-parent claim is false. Rebuild this ledger commit on top of the verifier (or otherwise merge that verifier into its ancestry).\n\nUseful? React with \ud83d\udc4d\u00a0/ \ud83d\udc4e.",
