              "body": "The actual GitHub head is `26822f159518a4fa49f2242227f4a460939d4e1e`, whose sole direct parent is the recorded verifier `08b588f6786c857070e350aeaa6396d85bcc004c`. GitHub git/commits returns that exact parent, matching local `git show --format='%H %P'`. `git merge-base --is-ancestor 08b588f6786c857070e350aeaa6396d85bcc004c 26822f159518a4fa49f2242227f4a460939d4e1e` exits 0. The PR retains both individual commits, so the verifier is reachable before merging and remains an ancestor after the required merge commit.\n\nThe finding instead checks `6b01e81c1a8bf5195eddf4932bc72aa1d7d99a51`, which is not this PR's head. No ancestry repair or history rewrite is warranted. The ledger row and direct-parent claim match the actual local and GitHub history. Resolving this false positive against the exact GitHub head; please review the actual PR head.",
